OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,5,     GTom Service talks to conductor
OL,6,     GCristian Macelaru, composer Dai
OL,7,     GFujikura, and as Artemis II
OL,8,     Gprepares to launch, he looks at
OL,9,     Gthe music that has been taken to
OL,10,     Gthe moon.
OL,11,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,12,     GJools is joined by musician and
OL,13,     Gbandleader David Hermlin.
OL,14,G1300FMusic Matters: The President and
OL,15,     Fthe Polka
OL,16,     GJustin Webb explores the
OL,17,     Grelationship between classical
OL,18,     Gmusic and American political
OL,19,     Ghistory. Today, music in the
OL,20,     Gservice of Cold War influence.
